he user to supply MAIL_USERNAME/MAIL_PASSWORD, then config:clear + cache:clear, then php artisan mail:check <address> --send. No real browser test has been run for any item; JS behaviour is covered by executing the shipped bundle as above and by source-level assertions elsewhere.
